; Filament-specific end gcode 
;END gcode for filament
M104 S0 T1 ; set temperature ;cooldown
; tool change custom gcode start


; keep previous extruder warm until ready to wipe:
M104 S190 T1


G1 Y0
G1 X0 F5000
